painting picture~
This is possibly one of the finest oil paintings you have ever seen.
It shows a couple standing together in each others arms on a deserted beach.
There is a full moon in the dark night sky and this is reflected in both the
sea and the lady's brown eyes.
Her long, brown, curled hair cascades down her shoulders. She is wearing a
long white dress, giving the impression that she is floating above the
ground. Around her neck she wears a very elegant cloak. She is standing here
staring in to the deep blue eyes of the gentleman she is with.
The gentleman is tall, strong, dark and handsome. His long black hair flows
down on to his broad shoulders. He is wearing some very fine clothes and
around his neck he is wearing an ermine lined dark cloak.
These two people are obviously very much in love and are an inspiration to us
all.
~
