#4380
The Mage's Laboratory.~
This room is filled with cobwebs and you deduce that it has not been used for
some time.

Unfortunately as you walk in to the room you catch the cobwebs and break them,
this causes a minor chain of events which eventually leads to a shelf falling
off the wall.

The shelf contained a number of bottles, these broke as they hit the ground
causing mysterious gases to be released. You can feel your armour melting
away, but you are unable to move as the gas that is filling your lungs is
making you feel faint. Eventually you are left standing naked and the room
itself now appears to be melting away from your vision, like a sweet dream in
the first light of dawn.
~
